+/// dropping an armed guard publishes terminal thread status before releasing
+/// process quiescence. A deep-sleep continuation can disarm it only through
+/// [`Self::admit_successor`], which performs successor admission itself and
+/// releases the predecessor lease only after admission returns successfully.
+#[derive(Debug)]
+#[must_use = "dropping accepted TaskWasm execution terminalizes its thread"]
